{"id":"c8e040945cb1c335","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory.md","title":"Craig Interpolation Theorem in Proof Theory","display":"thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory — Craig Interpolation Theorem in Proof Theory","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory","aliases":["72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory"],"display":"thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory — Craig Interpolation Theorem in Proof Theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-frege-system]]","[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 9.3; printed p. 612; PDF p. 624","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"Finite Boolean existential elimination and Frege soundness/completeness checked","round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory — Craig Interpolation Theorem in Proof Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f35aac82e2971e68\" href=\"?note=f35aac82e2971e68\" title=\"72-df-frege-system\">72-df-frege-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 9.3; printed p. 612; PDF p. 624"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Finite Boolean existential elimination and Frege soundness/completeness checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Taut}\">\\(\\mathsf{Taut}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi\">\\(R\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi\\)</span>，可证性如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f35aac82e2971e68\" href=\"?note=f35aac82e2971e68\" title=\"72-df-frege-system\">72-df-frege-system</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\Bigl(R\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\theta\\land R\\vdash\\theta\\to\\psi\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cap\\operatorname{Var}(\\psi)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\Bigl(R\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\theta\\land R\\vdash\\theta\\to\\psi\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cap\\operatorname{Var}(\\psi)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，§9.3，印刷页 612，PDF 页 624 的命题逻辑插值陈述；这里通过 Frege 可靠性及蕴涵完备性改写为可证性版本。不是一阶 Craig 插值的完整语汇版本。</li>\n<li>本地复核：枚举只出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中的变量之布尔赋值，对这些代入实例的析取取作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\bar q\\,\\varphi\">\\(\\exists\\bar q\\,\\varphi\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\models\\theta\">\\(\\varphi\\models\\theta\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\models\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\models\\psi\\)</span> 与非公共变量独立性推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\models\\psi\">\\(\\theta\\models\\psi\\)</span>；由完备性得到两个 Frege 证明。</li>\n<li>若公共变量为空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 取常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>；这依赖上游语法显式含有零元联结词。该存在性论证没有给出小公式或多项式时间提取界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-frege-system","status":"resolved","id":"f35aac82e2971e68","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-frege-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}$，$\\operatorname{Var}$、$\\mathsf{Taut}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-frege-system","status":"resolved","id":"f35aac82e2971e68","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$，$R\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi$，可证性如 [[72-df-frege-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Taut}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Frege}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\Bigl(R\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\theta\\land R\\vdash\\theta\\to\\psi\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cap\\operatorname{Var}(\\psi)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\bar q\\,\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\models\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\models\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\models\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":2047,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory|thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory — Craig Interpolation Theorem in Proof Theory]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory — Craig Interpolation Theorem in Proof Theory](72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-369","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory|thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory — Craig Interpolation Theorem in Proof Theory]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-489","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-interpolation-theorem-proof-theory]]"}],"outg